From 46a9125f8f74e3d56ef76e7b0e4d502a95afbbc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ValdikSS <iam@valdikss.org.ru>
Date: Tue, 20 Jan 2026 07:16:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add Dual Channel into Bluetooth Audio Channel Mode
 developer options menu

Add UI support for SBC Dual Channel (SBC HD) mode in the Bluetooth Audio
Channel Mode dialog within Developer Options.

This commit:
- Adds "Dual Channel" radio button to the channel mode dialog layout
- Updates BluetoothChannelModeDialogPreference to dynamically add the option
- Updates BluetoothChannelModeDialogPreferenceController to handle the new mode
- Updates AbstractBluetoothDialogPreferenceController with DUAL_CHANNEL constant
- Force-enables Dual Channel selection for SBC codec

Adapted for Android 16 QPR1 from LineageOS patches.

Co-authored-by: Flopster101 <nahuelgomez329@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Flopster101 <nahuelgomez329@gmail.com>
Change-Id: Icd3179ac63310355547fd58060e75f25b4a8210d
---
 .../bluetooth_audio_channel_mode_dialog.xml   |  4 ++++
 ...ctBluetoothDialogPreferenceController.java |  7 +++++-
 .../BluetoothChannelModeDialogPreference.java | 14 +++++++++---
