             BluetoothCodecConfig.BITS_PER_SAMPLE_24,
             BluetoothCodecConfig.BITS_PER_SAMPLE_16};
+    // CHANNEL_MODE_DUAL_CHANNEL is @hide in BluetoothCodecConfig, so we define it locally
